					<<case forest lake>>
						You hide behind a tree and hope that no one's watching.
					<<case moor>>
						You crouch behind a small ridge and hope that no one's watching.
					<<default>>
						You dive down a small alley and take cover behind a dumpster.
				<</switch>>
